    "explanation": "<p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">The measures of central tendency are values that represent the 'average' or 'middle' of a dataset. These include the median, mean, and mode. In box plots, the median is shown as the line inside the box and indicates the middle value when data is ordered.</p>",
